Tests: smoke
Depends: @, python3, python3-pil, python3-serial, desktop-file-utils
Restrictions: superficial

# What this test is for: the things that can only be measured after an install, in
# the layout an install produces.  The offline checks (`tests/`) cover the
# protocol, the renders and the window from a checkout; none of it can see whether
# pybuild put the modules where the interpreter looks, whether the clips the
# packaging installs are the ones the code then finds by its own root rules, or
# whether the menu entry and the unit survive a trip through debhelper.
#
# `Restrictions: superficial` because it reboots nothing and touches no hardware: it
# renders to a file and never opens a serial port.  PyQt6 and the themes package are
# not in Depends on purpose - the test says what it skipped rather than pulling 100+
# MB of Qt into a run that is checking packaging.  Run it by hand on an installed
# system too (debian/README.source, "Testing").
